  "description": "<p data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"141\"><strong data-start=\"57\" data-end=\"141\">Gezellige collectie van klassieke bord-, kaart- en partyspellen – In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"505\"><em data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"163\">51 Worldwide Games</em> biedt een ruime verzameling van <strong data-start=\"196\" data-end=\"224\">51 verschillende spellen</strong>, variërend van bordspellen en kaartspellen tot sport- en partygames. Ideaal voor zowel solo-spelers als voor vrienden en familie. Dankzij de duidelijke uitleg, sfeervolle presentatie en toegankelijke gameplay is dit een perfecte titel voor gezellige avonden en korte speelsessies.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"507\" data-end=\"598\">Dit exemplaar betreft een <strong data-start=\"533\" data-end=\"552\">losse cartridge</strong> (geen doosje) en verkeert <strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"597\">In Nette Staat</strong>.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"649\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"649\">Waarom 51 Worldwide Games een ideale keuze is</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<li data-start=\"651\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<p data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"699\">🎲 51 verschillende spellen in één collectie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"759\">🧩 Van schaak en dammen tot darts, bowling en blackjack</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"814\">\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"814\">👪 Perfect voor familie, vrienden en casual gamers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"848\">\r\n<p data-start=\"817\" data-end=\"848\">🎮 Zowel solo als multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"889\">\r\n<p data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"889\">🧱 <strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"873\">Losse cartridge</strong> (geen doosje)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"910\">\r\n<p data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"910\">✨ In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"912\" data-end=\"915\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"917\" data-end=\"941\">📋 <strong data-start=\"924\" data-end=\"941\">Specificaties</strong></h3>\r\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\r\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<thead data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"967\">\r\n<th data-start=\"943\" data-end=\"956\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Eigenschap</th>\r\n<th data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"967\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Details</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<tr data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1033\">\r\n<td data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1005\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Soort game</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Party-/bordspelcollectie</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1064\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1045\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Platform</td>\r\n<td data-start=\"1045\" data-end=\"1064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Nintendo Switch</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1088\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1082\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Aantal spellen</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1088\">51</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1132\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1089\" data-end=\"1102\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Speelmodus</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1132\">Singleplayer & multiplayer</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1170\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1147\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Meegeleverd</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1168\">Losse cartridge</strong></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1197\">\r\n<td data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1179\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Staat</td>\r\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1179\" data-end=\"1197\">In Nette Staat</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1202\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1240\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1240\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</strong></p>",
